comment author Shinryuu
comment v5.4: v5.3 with both Wily Machine fights faster (Wily 6 starts 8 frames earlier): Mega Man tracks the machine's left side so every Metal Blade hit lands on the best frame, and during the phase change he parks stationary blades (up+down throws) that keep every phase-2 throw on even slots; Wily 6 platform seeds kept in range. v5.3: alien fight 2 frames faster (pause-menu up+down cursor trick flips the hit parity; Mega Man ends his stun at X 37.06 on the secret ledge). v5.2: one lag frame removed before Wily 4 (Mega Man hops into Metal Man's boss door). v5.1: combined movie. Shinryuu's unpublished, faster run (reconstructed from his video) from the start to Wily 4, combined with our improvements (v3 Guts Tank fight, v4.1 Wily 4, v4.2 Wily 5/6) and two Wily 5 refight levers: the Air Man refight is 11 frames faster (Leaf Shield deployed right after the first hit and thrown while Mega Man rises, between the tornado rows), so the Wood Man fill ends 12 frames earlier; the Metal Man refight is 2 frames faster and the Flash capsule is reached 1 frame sooner, so the Flash Man fill ends 4 frames earlier. Refight RNG re-synced through capsule subpixels; Wily 6 platform seeds set with Metal Blade knobs. 250 frames faster than publication 4410.
